# --- Note on data/ and vector_store/ ---
# NOT excluded here on purpose: the 12 source PDFs (data/raw/, ~72KB total)
# and the ChromaDB vector store (~600KB for 68 chunks) are both well under
# the 50MB threshold, so they are committed directly. This keeps the repo
# runnable immediately after `git clone` without requiring anyone to
# re-run the notebook just to get the backend working.
